Subject: [PATCH 39/68] feat(brain): add profile table, MCP tools, and
 CLAUDE.md instructions

- brain.profile table with key-value rows, confidence scores, source
  tracking (declared/inferred/confirmed), and vector embeddings
- profile + update_profile MCP tools with semantic search support
- CLAUDE.md Personal Profile section for reciprocal disclosure guidance

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
